# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1313
msgid ""
"``(float, -1 to 1)`` Vertical position of the light source. -1 is top edge, "
"0 is center, +1 is bottom edge."
msgstr ""
"``(float, -1 à 1)`` Position verticale de la source lumineuse. -1 est le "
"bord supérieur, 0 le centre, +1 le bord inférieur."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1314
msgid ""
"``(float, 0 to 1)`` Overall glow strength and transparency. Higher values "
"make brighter, more opaque flares."
msgstr ""
"``(float, 0 à 1)`` Intensité globale de la lueur et transparence. Des "
"valeurs plus élevées rendent les éblouissements plus lumineux et opaques."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1315
msgid ""
"``(float, 0.1 to 3)`` Scale of the entire flare effect. Larger values "
"enlarge halos, rings and glows."
msgstr ""
"``(float, 0.1 à 3)`` Échelle de l'effet d'éblouissement complet. Des valeurs"
" plus grandes agrandissent les halos, anneaux et lueurs."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../effects.rst:1316
msgid ""
"``(float, 0 to 1)`` How far secondary reflections travel. 0 keeps them close"
